What was built
Monorepo structure

apps/api — NestJS backend (Modules 1–5)
apps/web — Next.js 15 + Tailwind frontend (Module 6)
packages/shared — Fee math, Zod schemas, constants
packages/db — Prisma schema, migrations, seed
packages/integrations — Adapter interfaces with mock + live clients
Backend modules

Aggregation — Worker-thread parallel fetches, TicketsData /fetch + /match, retry policy (503/504 ×2 @ 1.5s/3s), listing upsert
Transfers — SafeTix upload block, TM cart lifecycle + cleanup jobs, NFL/NHL/MLB adapters, transfer state machine
Payments — Stripe Connect Separate Charges & Transfers, escrow tiers, seller onboarding, dispute halt
Compliance — MA affidavits/consent, $2 markup cap, 1099-K at $5k gross
Security — Captcha, behavioral risk scoring, SMS 2FA, velocity limits (max 6 tickets), proxy ASN blocking
Frontend views

/ and /events — Discovery with league/team/date/price filters and all-in pricing
/events/[id] — SVG stadium map, arbitrage highlights, listing table
/sell — Listing portal with live net payout (P_L × 0.95) and MA compliance forms
/checkout/[listingId] — Checkout with fee line items and refund guarantee
/dashboard — Seller escrow/transfer/1099 status
